    "description": "Led design and development of key elements for new SPECweb2005 internet performance benchmark suite used to evaluate and improve server performance. Collaborated  with multidisciplinary teams of engineers, managers, and marketing, to develop project through all phases from requirements through product release.\n\n• Selected as primary representative to Standard Performance Evaluation Consortia (SPEC),  holding technical as well as executive and supervisory roles within the consortia.\n• Developed Java-based file set generator to automate generation of static and scaling elements of Web server’s fileset and prototyped improvements to multi-threaded JAVA-based test harness.  \n• Participated in troubleshooting numerous cross-platform issues throughout benchmark development, promptly identifying, debugging, and resolving issues.",
