    "description": "Spearheaded development and implementation of secure web server benchmark, SPECweb99_SSL (using OpenSSL). Served key role in design and development of web server benchmark as well as Java and Mail server benchmarks. Performed ongoing troubleshooting of a broad range of UNIX issues, ensuring prompt and accurate resolutions. Provided systems performance consulting and benchmarking to marketing, sales, and engineering teams company-wide. \n• Elected Chair of SPEC’s Open Systems Steering Committee; elected to SPEC Board of Directors.\n• Served as Compaq primary SPEC representative and technical representative on Web, Java, Mailserver, and CPU subcommittees.\n• Trained team members to become SPEC technical representatives",
